1	/**
2	 * Feature-Tasks-Done checker — polls for features where all tasks are done
3	 * and fires the Handoff Trigger.
4	 *
5	 * Runs on every poll cycle (after handleMergedPrs). Reads task YAMLs from
6	 * origin/<featureBranch> — the authoritative multi-task view — rather than
7	 * from the local FS of a single task branch.
